Thai document OCR (Tier 1). Return ONLY valid JSON object.

Required fields:
- document_type_keyword ("TAX_INVOICE"|"RECEIPT"|"DELIVERY_NOTE"|"QUOTATION"|"OTHER")
- issuer_tax_id
- issuer_name
- invoice_date (YYYY-MM-DD)
- vat_amount
- total_amount
- is_handwritten

Optional fields (include only if visible):
- issuer_address (full address of issuer/seller)
- issuer_postal_code
- issuer_branch_id (branch number or "สำนักงานใหญ่")
- invoice_number
- currency
- net_amount_ex_vat (subtotal before VAT)

Rules:
- No guessing: missing => {"value":null,"confidence":0.3}
- Partially readable => confidence 0.4-0.7
- Raw numeric values only (no commas/currency words)
- Convert พ.ศ. to ค.ศ. (subtract 543)
- If issuer_tax_id exists and vat_amount > 0, prefer TAX_INVOICE
- Escape all internal double-quotes in string values

Return format:
{ "field_name": { "value": ..., "confidence": 0.0-1.0 } }
